<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
THESIS: interrogar a un país sintético construido con sus datos reales — no un
dashboard de cifras sino gente (simulada) que responde.
OWN-WORLD: hereda el mundo pixel del visor (baseplate azul-noche, Silkscreen,
bordes chunky, colores por estado); aquí los protagonistas son los residentes.
STORY: eliges un departamento, ves quién lo habita (números DANE reales vs la
población sintética), y le preguntas lo que quieras: 8 residentes contestan en
personaje y la postura se cuenta en vivo. Disclaimer siempre visible: simulación.
FIRST VIEWPORT: header con selector de departamento; izquierda el censo del dpto
(pirámide real vs sintética, régimen, economía); centro la encuesta con las
respuestas llegando; derecha la ficha del dpto (dossier) y residentes de muestra.
FORM: continuación del arcade-mission-control del visor, pinneado por Daniel.
-->
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ColombIA ¡Que Piensa!</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="../assets/quepiensa_48.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Silkscreen:wght@400;700&family=Saira:wdth,wght@75..100,300..700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#10141f;--panel:#161b29;--panel2:#131724;--grid:#1e2436;--text:#eef0f4;
--dim:#9aa3b8;--faint:#7d879c;--work:#ffd23e;--ok:#59d97e;--fail:#ff5c5c;
--accent:#5aa7ff;--muj:#ff6fa5;--hom:#4dd6c1;--px:3px}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:"Saira",system-ui,sans-serif;
font-stretch:90%;font-size:13px;min-height:100vh}
.pxf{font-family:"Silkscreen",monospace}
.panel{background:var(--panel);border:var(--px) solid var(--grid)}
.panel>h2{font-family:"Silkscreen";font-size:10px;color:var(--dim);padding:7px 10px 5px;
border-bottom:var(--px) solid var(--grid);text-transform:lowercase;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px}
select,button,input{background:var(--panel2);color:var(--text);border:2px solid var(--grid);
font:inherit;font-size:12.5px;padding:5px 9px;cursor:pointer}
select:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--work)}
.pxbtn{font-family:"Silkscreen";font-size:10px;box-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000a}
.pxbtn:active{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:none}

#app{max-width:1500px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px;display:grid;gap:8px;
grid-template-columns:340px 1fr 320px;
grid-template-areas:"top top top" "censo encuesta ficha" "banner banner banner"}
#top{grid-area:top;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:8px 12px;
background:var(--panel);border:var(--px) solid var(--grid);flex-wrap:wrap}
#title{font-family:"Silkscreen";font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:var(--work);
text-shadow:3px 3px 0 #0007}
#title small{color:var(--fable,#ff8a65);font-size:16px}
#logo{image-rendering:pixelated;border:2px solid var(--grid);margin-right:-6px;
background:#fff;box-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000a}
#lema{font-style:normal;display:block;font-size:8px;color:var(--faint);
letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:1px;animation:lemain .8s steps(6) both .3s}
@keyframes lemain{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(3px)}}
#dptosel{min-width:250px;font-size:13.5px;padding:7px 10px;border-color:var(--work)}
#kpis{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:18px;text-align:right}
#kpis div b{display:block;font-family:"Silkscreen";font-size:12px;color:var(--text);font-weight:400}
#kpis div span{font-size:10px;color:var(--faint)}
a.back{color:var(--faint);text-decoration:none;font-size:11px}
a.back:hover{color:var(--work)}

#censo{grid-area:censo;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;background:none;border:none}
#censo .panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0}
#censo .body{padding:12px 14px;overflow-y:auto}
/* mapa-navegador: el país siempre a la vista, clic = elegir territorio */
#navmap{padding:8px 8px 4px;position:relative}
#navmap svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
#navmap path{fill:var(--panel2);stroke:#2a3350;stroke-width:1.2;cursor:pointer;
transition:fill .6s ease,stroke .25s ease,stroke-width .25s ease;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-linecap:round}
#navmap svg{filter:drop-shadow(0 5px 0 #00000055)}
#navmap path:hover{stroke:var(--work);stroke-width:2}
#navmap path:focus{outline:none}
#navmap path:focus-visible{outline:none;stroke:var(--work);stroke-width:2.5}
#navmap path.sel{stroke:var(--work);stroke-width:2.5;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 4px #ffd23e66)}
/* spotlight: al pasar por un territorio, el resto respira hacia atrás */
#navmap svg.spot path{opacity:.42;transition:opacity .25s ease,fill .6s ease,stroke .25s ease}
#navmap svg.spot path.hov,#navmap svg.spot path.sel,#navmap svg.spot path.hot{opacity:1}
#navmap path.hov{stroke:var(--work);stroke-width:2;filter:brightness(1.25) drop-shadow(0 0 5px #ffd23e44)}
#navmap path.press{filter:brightness(.7);transition:filter .06s}
/* tooltip flotante pixel */
#maptip{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;z-index:5;background:var(--panel);
border:2px solid var(--work);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 #000c;padding:6px 9px;
font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--dim);max-width:200px;display:none}
#maptip b{font-family:"Silkscreen";font-size:9px;color:var(--work);display:block}
#maptip .st{color:var(--text)}
#navmap path.fav,#navmap path.con,#navmap path.dep{animation:aterriza .7s ease}
@keyframes aterriza{0%{fill-opacity:.2}60%{fill-opacity:1;filter:brightness(1.35)}100%{filter:none}}
#navmap path.fav{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok) 45%,var(--panel2))}
#navmap path.con{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--fail) 45%,var(--panel2))}
#navmap path.dep{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--work) 40%,var(--panel2))}
#navmap path.hot{stroke:var(--work);animation:pulsohot 1.1s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulsohot{0%,100%{stroke-width:1.6;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 1px var(--work))}
50%{stroke-width:3;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 7px var(--work))}}
#maplabel{font-family:"Silkscreen";font-size:9px;color:var(--work);text-align:center;
padding:5px 0 3px;min-height:20px;letter-spacing:.06em}
#ctrl{display:none;gap:4px}
#ctrl button{font-family:"Silkscreen";font-size:8px;padding:3px 8px}
#ctrl button.pausa{color:var(--work);border-color:var(--work)}
#reloj{font-family:"Silkscreen";font-size:9px;color:var(--faint)}
.acuerdo{flex:1 1 100%;border:2px solid var(--grid);padding:6px 10px}
.acuerdo .t{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:4px}
.acuerdo .t b{font-family:"Silkscreen";font-size:10px;color:var(--text);font-weight:400}
.acuerdo .g{height:10px;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--grid);display:flex}
.acuerdo .g i{height:100%}
h3{font-family:"Silkscreen";font-size:9px;color:var(--faint);margin:18px 0 8px;font-weight:400;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
h3::after{content:"";flex:1;height:2px;background:var(--grid)}
h3:first-child{margin-top:0}
